# ---- Sprint 4a rows: async bootout, the launcher, the settings writer, and the round 4 carry-over (attended, post, direct exec, settings step) ----
# The "-fast" rows run only the part of Tests/cli.test.sh that holds the rule (CLAWD_TEST_STOP_AFTER), so a row costs about a minute.
